Package: rbdoom-3-bfg
Architecture: amd64
Depends: doom3bfg-data, hicolor-icon-theme, libvulkan1, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: mesa-vulkan-drivers | vulkan-icd
Suggests: rbdoom-3-bfg-gi-data
Description: Doom 3 BFG Edition with modern engine features
 RBDOOM-3-BFG is Robert Beckebans' modernized Doom 3 BFG Edition engine,
 with Vulkan rendering through NVIDIA's NVRHI, physically based rendering,
 baked global illumination, soft shadows and retro rendering modes. It needs the
 retail Doom 3 BFG Edition data (doom3bfg-data) and a Vulkan driver.
 .
 This is version 1.6.0, built from source; Debian's own rbdoom3bfg package
 is the older OpenGL-based 1.4.0 and can be installed alongside it.
